      "title": "Contact and Access Directions <br>"
    },
    "directions": {
      "body": "<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9c1bb07b1a8871a3a2910856bc988e62\" style=\"font-size:18px;font-style:normal;font-weight:300\"><strong>The school is located on</strong> the Montegancedo Campus, which is part of the UPM, within a residential area called Urbanización Montepríncipe. This area is situated on the outskirts of a small residential village named Boadilla del Monte, located approximately 7 km southwest of Madrid.<br><br><strong>Once you have accessed the Campus:</strong> You will encounter three buildings, one white and two green. Our offices are located in the larger green building (block 2). The Doctoral Program Secretary’s Office is in room D-2213. <br><br><strong>Contacto:</strong> <br>Department of Artificial Intelligence<br>School of Computer Engineering<br>Universidad Politécnica de Madrid<br>28660 Boadilla del Monte, Madrid, España</h2>",
